    "pruning_radius": "Student-t L2 radius of next free s' around s+delta_mean; Q_single uses delta_mean; RA-DQN uses the live env",
    "delta_estimation": "Exclude boundary cancel/clip from delta and Lipschitz sample sets so deterministic regions can report std\u22480 for the free step"
